# Credentials that must never be committed. GitHub push protection caught a Google Cloud
# service-account key here on 2026-08-22, swept in by a `git add -A`; the commit was local only
# and was removed. Patterns, not one filename, because the next key will be named something else.
Google Cloud/
*service*account*.json
*-*.json.key
gha-creds-*.json

# Generated store assets and bytecode; the canonical PNGs live beside the generator.
docs/store-assets/out/
__pycache__/
